{"4794140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bean Base", "steam_appid": 4794140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a base building, farming, survival game set in space. You are responsible for growing crops and providing food to local colonies in your star system. Build your space station in any design or shape you want! Go explore the stars and find unique items that you can use to decorate and show off your adventures. Or just sit back and relax as you create a cozy atmosphere in your own little Bean Base.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a base building, farming, survival game set in space. You are responsible for growing crops and providing food to local colonies in your star system. Build your space station in any design or shape you want! Go explore the stars and find unique items that you can use to decorate and show off your adventures. Or just sit back and relax as you create a cozy atmosphere in your own little Bean Base.</p>", "short_description": "Bean Base is a survival base building farming game where you are solely responsible for your very own space station. Grow crops, explore the stars, and decorate your base; however you want to, survive the elements of space.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794140/56cbce56e058492abce9efba49aab7f352eb9411/header.jpg?t=1780457381", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794140/765e72d2c26188e6c6b5ef8e137f53b7622115c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780457381", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4794140/765e72d2c26188e6c6b5ef8e137f53b7622115c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780457381", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class